                    {
                        "sense_id": "2c9a0f57-cbf0-32c7-8c55-7edb71d27de9",
                        "entry_id": "d42de9b7-68b2-3ddb-b213-992aeda911e0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The penis or vulva; genitalia."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "childish",
                            "colloquial",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6deb2ef-123c-4c6e-9f15-5c08bfd5884c",
                                "sense_id": "2c9a0f57-cbf0-32c7-8c55-7edb71d27de9",
                                "text": "[…]while passing the sponge over the upper part of the little fellow's thighs, the nurse cried out, \"O, doctor! be very careful—don't touch his pee-pee—it's very sore;\" and upon examining his penis I found it in a state of extreme erection."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c3b6201-07f2-45bf-9878-9e993c66ea12",
                                "sense_id": "2c9a0f57-cbf0-32c7-8c55-7edb71d27de9",
                                "text": "A pee-pee for making Wee-Wee."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "279c7ce8-27c6-4d71-90df-019a821e910f",
                                "sense_id": "2c9a0f57-cbf0-32c7-8c55-7edb71d27de9",
                                "text": "Using the word familiar to Claude[…], I said that he seemed to be afraid that he would lose \"his pee-pee\", since he imagined that his sister and his mother had lost theirs[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4bbe9548-38c4-4d73-bcdd-a47ed4884162",
                                "sense_id": "2c9a0f57-cbf0-32c7-8c55-7edb71d27de9",
                                "text": "While washing her daughter's hair, Suzie looked up and asked her if she would wash her \"pee-pee\" too."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28eac38a-1102-404c-9f28-5fbe6d623a2b",
                                "sense_id": "2c9a0f57-cbf0-32c7-8c55-7edb71d27de9",
                                "text": "When asked if Hubie touched her pee-pee or if she touched Hubie's pee-pee, she repeatedly replied, “No.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2edf420-cd7c-4898-a4fb-13d40fd182f3",
                                "sense_id": "2c9a0f57-cbf0-32c7-8c55-7edb71d27de9",
                                "text": "She has also said her dad is mean and hurt her pee pee. She ask^([sic]) a lot about if people are going to look at her pee pee (i.e. Doctors, different apts. we go to, that is her first question to me)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
